COMMENT ON COLUMN public.user_phoneme_stats.phoneme IS 'IPA symbol (e.g., /u/, /ÃƒÆ’Ã…Â Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â/, /ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Â°ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚ÂºÃƒÆ’Ã…â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢/)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.user_phoneme_stats.attempts IS 'Number of times this phoneme has been tested';
