-- ============================================
-- MIGRATION 1: HABITS & GOALS TABLES
-- ============================================
-- Purpose: Creates tables for habits tracking and goals management
-- Status: NEW - Tom's repo does NOT have these tables
-- Run: Copy entire file into Supabase SQL Editor and execute
